## 🔄 3. CI/CD Pipeline (GitHub Actions)

The [ci-cd.yaml](file:///Users/muneeb/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nsip/.github/workflows/ci-cd.yaml) implements a 5-stage pipeline:

```mermaid
graph LR
    A["Stage 1: Build & Test<br/>Java (Matrix: 9 services)"] --> D
    B["Stage 2: Build & Test<br/>React Web App"] --> D
    C["Stage 3: Build & Test<br/>Flutter Mobile App"] --> E["Stage 5: Deploy to K8s"]
    D["Stage 4: Docker Build<br/>& Push to GHCR"] --> E
```

| Stage | Trigger | What it does |
|---|---|---|
| **Build Backend** | Every push/PR | Runs `mvnw clean verify` on all 9 services in parallel (matrix strategy) |
| **Build Web** | Every push/PR | Runs `npm ci && npm run build` on the React app |
| **Build Mobile** | Every push/PR | Runs `flutter analyze && flutter test` |
| **Docker Publish** | Merge to `main` only | Builds Docker images, pushes to GitHub Container Registry |
| **Deploy K8s** | After Docker push | Applies all K8s manifests + rolling restart of deployments |

